				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Please note that this is only a preliminary screening tool and do not assume that a particular “score” means the client has a particular mental disorder. Many people have symptoms like those described in this screening tool, but do not have a “disorder.” Remember that diagnoses should be made only by a trained clinician after a thorough assessment. "
